/*
 * Shared test fixture — not shipped in any package.
 *
 * Parity fixture for the stat fields merged into data/ships/modules-*.jsonc
 * (engineering/mechanical stats, the defence stats — resistances, hull boost and reinforcement —
 * and the weapon stats), including fitted-weapon normalization. Cross-language validation.
 *
 * The fixed Guardian Gauss Cannon damage rows pin stock outfitting-panel readings transcribed
 * 2026-08-12 UTC: 22.0 for the small 1D cannon and 38.5 for the medium 2B cannon. A live panel has
 * no immutable revision or export; the displayed values are stored without correction.
 */
